     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>It is possible to take the data files, i.e. not code and not additional html/css/images, and create a tar/zip file of them which is then included in the bundle that is deployed as your application. Your application would then need to unpack the tar/zip file on startup.<br></div></div>"
    ],
